## The challenge

The [WAGMI Defense](https://wagmigame.io/en) leadership team—including senior veterans from Electronic Arts, Call of Duty, and Apple—wanted a mobile RTS game that stood on real gameplay quality first while integrating non-custodial wallets, NFT cards, and tokenomics.

## What we did

- **Architected core rules and progression.** Defined character power, damage, speed, and level-scaling formulas alongside the engineering team.
- **Tightened Agile execution.** Structured sprint ceremonies and backlog prioritization across 15+ game, backend, Web3, and QA specialists, lifting velocity by 40%.
- **Aligned contract model to product stage.** Transitioned the engagement from a Fixed-Price MVP into an ongoing hourly T&M model for continuous Live Ops.

## What shipped

Reached 5,000 beta downloads in month one and 20,000+ within three months post-launch with a 4.5★ store rating.
